Index/CxxAlgorithms.swift (and Index/CxxPriorityQueue.swift over it) is a
translation to Swift of std::sort and the heap
algorithms (push_heap, pop_heap, make_heap, sort_heap and their sift helpers)
of libc++, part of the LLVM Project, as found in the macOS SDK of Xcode
(usr/include/c++/v1/__algorithm/sort.h, push_heap.h, pop_heap.h,
sift_down.h, make_heap.h). That code is under the Apache License v2.0 with
LLVM Exceptions (SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception),
https://llvm.org/LICENSE.txt. Copyright the LLVM Project contributors.
